# Project Overview

React 19 + Vite + TypeScript (strict) frontend template.

## Tech Stack
- UI: MUI (Material UI)
- State: Redux Toolkit + Context API
- Routing: React Router v6
- HTTP: Axios with global interceptors
- Testing: Jest + React Testing Library
- Linting: ESLint (Airbnb) + Prettier
- Git Hooks: Husky + lint-staged

## Folder Structure (Layer-Based)
```
src/
├── assets/          # Static files
├── components/      # Reusable components
│   ├── common/      # Shared (Toast, Loading)
│   └── error-boundary/
├── constants/       # App constants
├── contexts/        # Context providers
├── hooks/           # Custom hooks
├── pages/           # Page components
├── routes/          # Router config
├── services/api/    # Axios + API services
├── store/slices/    # Redux store
├── theme/           # MUI theme
├── types/           # Global types
└── utils/           # Utilities
```

## Path Alias
Use `@/` → `src/` for all internal imports.

## Import Order
1. React → 2. Third-party → 3. Internal (`@/`) → 4. Styles
